==Battleground==
*1 [[Croakley]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[H. Nah]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Lure H. Nah near your base and kill him using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Make sure there aren't any Those Guys nearby as they will block Bahamut's attack and result in his death from H. Nah's attacks. After H. Nah is killed, the stage becomes much simpler, as Croakley isn't much of a threat due to his low offensive capabilities, Bahamut will easily destroy this stage after.

If one has Awakened Bahamut's talents, this stage becomes even more of a cakewalk.

